# =============================================================================
# Dockerfile Misconfigurations - Accepted Risks
# =============================================================================
# These are Trivy misconfiguration checks that are intentionally accepted.

# AVD-DS-0001 - Base image uses :latest tag for continuous development (REVIEW BY: 2027-07-05)
# The nemotron-base image uses :latest tag because:
# 1. The base image is built and published from the same repository
# 2. Using :latest allows automatic pickup of base image updates
# 3. Production deployments can pin to specific SHA tags if needed
# 4. The base image build is controlled and not external
AVD-DS-0001

# AVD-DS-0002 - vsftpd requires root to bind to privileged port 21 (REVIEW BY: 2027-07-05)
# vsftpd is an FTP server that needs root privileges to:
# 1. Bind to port 21 (privileged port)
# 2. Create system users via useradd/chpasswd in entrypoint
# 3. Manage FTP user sessions
# The service is isolated in its own container with limited network exposure.
AVD-DS-0002

